  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Life; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 250 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nAn emergency tool for removing enchantments in a hurry. When a person drinks the elixir, he may choose a single ongoing magical effect affecting him. The elixir attempts a magic skill check with an MSB of +5 to dispel the effect, as the Counterspell feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Life sphere (Break Enchantment); <strong>Cost</strong> 175 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc114\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: lesser, 250 gp.</p><p>Preserve the published 250 gp purchase price and original 175 gp construction figure without deriving one from the other. One dose affects a single chosen ongoing effect on the drinker, not all magic or a generic Break Enchantment spell.</p><p>Single-dose quantity is consumed through the native helper. Target outcomes, temporary effects and any external eligibility remain deliberate; carrying the bottle grants no persistent bonus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
